      <activity id="f376ed1b-ec7f-5a52-a2b6-fc4073562158" activityNameId="dad7ce5d-0660-5169-bd45-2102bee041c1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation exergy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation exergy
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation exergy' delivers the coproducts 'electricity, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation exergy' and 'heat, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation exergy'. The exergy allocation is the allocation scheme suggested to be used within ecoinvent (e.g. in electricity mixes).;
UUID: a1d97f81-0932-3069-84cc-8ce236ae83f3
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: Efficiencies refer to a specific plant in Switzerland.
Technology: Specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Emission measurements of operator, literature. Efficiencies from operator data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a1d97f81-0932-3069-84cc-8ce236ae83f3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
